{
  "key": 18323,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnAreYouCatchingPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Are you catching Pokémon?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnWowAlreadyGotXPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! You’ve already got {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} Pokémon\n",
        "with you!\r",
        "At that pace, your Pokédex should\n",
        "be full in no time at all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnSaferIfYouCatchMore",
      "en_US": [
        "...Um...\r",
        "I think you’d feel a lot safer if you\n",
        "were to catch some more.\r",
        "You know, like when you need to travel\n",
        "to faraway places.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I know! Don’t you think it’s\n",
        "better to know more about Pokémon?\r",
        "Sure it is!\n",
        "I know just the place.\r",
        "Come on!\n",
        "Don’t be shy. Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasHowManyPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "How many Pokémon have you caught?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasYouAlreadyHaveXPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoa! You already have {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} Pokémon\n",
        "with you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasYouShouldCatchMore",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "I think you should catch some more.\r",
        "It might be more of a challenge\n",
        "raising a lot of Pokémon...\r",
        "But it’s worth it. The more Pokémon\n",
        "you have, the happier you’ll be.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, that’s right! Don’t you think it’s\n",
        "better to know more about Pokémon?\r",
        "Sure it is!\n",
        "There’s this great place for that.\r",
        "Come on! It’s all right.\n",
        "Follow me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnWhatIsHeDoing",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: That man...\n",
        "What is he doing?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnUm",
      "en_US": "Dawn: Um..."
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasWhatsHeDoing",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: That guy...\n",
        "What’s he doing?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasUhExcuse",
      "en_US": "Lucas: Uh, excuse..."
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WHAAAT",
      "en_US": "WHAAAT?!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HowDidYouUnmaskMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Mysterious man: ...How did you know?\r",
        "How did you unmask me as a member of\n",
        "the International Police?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnJustMakingConversation",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Huh? What? I beg your pardon?\n",
        "I was just making conversation...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasJustMakingSmallTalk",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Huh? What? Are you kidding?\n",
        "I was just making small talk...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_IKnowBetter",
      "en_US": [
        "Shady man: ...Heh. You claim you were\n",
        "only making conversation, do you?\r",
        "But, I know better not to believe that.\n",
        "No, no, no.\r",
        "You recognized right away that I was\n",
        "someone extraordinary.\r",
        "That is why you spoke to me, is it not?\n",
        "Your power of observation is fearsome!\r",
        "Quite admirable, you are!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_IsSayingFamiliarToYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Now that my cover has been blown, let\n",
        "me introduce myself.\r",
        "I am a globe-trotting elite of the\n",
        "International Police.\r",
        "My name... Ah, no, I shall inform you\n",
        "only of my code name.\r",
        "My code name, it is Looker.\n",
        "It is what they all call me.\r",
        "Incidentally, is the saying, “Don’t be\n",
        "a thief!” familiar to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_TakingFromOthersIsWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Yes, that is correct.\n",
        "Taking what belongs to others is wrong.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_YouClaimToNotKnowIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: No? You claim to not know it?\n",
        "How could that be?\r",
        "Perhaps your mama has said it, but you\n",
        "have forgotten it, like usual?\r",
        "Now listen, my friends. It is wrong to\n",
        "take what belongs to others.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PerhapsYouCanUseThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Unfortunately, there are apparently\n",
        "those who do not heed those words.\r",
        "In Sinnoh, in fact, there are criminals\n",
        "stealing the Pokémon of others.\r",
        "I have, therefore, been on the lookout\n",
        "for characters arousing my suspicion.\r",
        "Incidentally, you are Trainers, yes?\n",
        "Perhaps you can make use of this?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DeviceForRecordingAMatch",
      "en_US": [
        "That Vs. Recorder, it is a nifty device\n",
        "for recording a match.\r",
        "I obtained it because it is quite popular\n",
        "these days.\r",
        "But myself, I do not do Pokémon\n",
        "battling very often.\r",
        "It will be in better hands with you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_InformMeOfAnyHappenings",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Also, I have a request.\r",
        "If you were to see me again, I ask that\n",
        "you not talk to me, for I am on duty.\r",
        "...Actually, yes, yes, you may speak to\n",
        "me. You must.\r",
        "Not because I am lonely, no, no!\n",
        "You must inform me of bad guys!\f",
        "You must inform me of any happenings!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnInternationPoliceMustBeHard",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: ...Working for the International\n",
        "Police must be hard.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnHereIsTheTrainersSchool",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, here it is.\n",
        "It’s the Trainers’ School.\f",
        "The name says it all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnRivalWentInEarlier",
      "en_US": [
        "I saw your friend {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} go in\n",
        "earlier.\r",
        "He could still be in there studying.\n",
        "OK, bye now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasInternationPoliceSoundsHard",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: ...Working for the International\n",
        "Police sounds hard.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasThisIsTheTrainersSchool",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, here we are.\n",
        "This is the Trainers’ School.\f",
        "The name says it all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasRivalWentInEarier",
      "en_US": [
        "Your pal {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} went in earlier.\n",
        "He might still be studying in there.\r",
        "OK, see you around!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_CarvedOutOfAMountain",
      "en_US": [
        "Jubilife City’s built on land they\n",
        "carved out of a mountain.\r",
        "The people and Pokémon of Oreburgh\n",
        "City helped out with that undertaking."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HaveYouVisitedTVStation",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! Let me ask you, have you paid\n",
        "a visit to the TV station?\r",
        "If you’ve never been, you owe it to\n",
        "yourself to make the trip.\r",
        "And, if you’ve been there before,\n",
        "it never hurts to visit again.\r",
        "After all, you can be a star!\n",
        "Or at least dream of being one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_ItIsYouHaveYouVisitedTrainersSchool",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it is you! Have no fear.\n",
        "There are no shady characters about.\r",
        "Incidentally, have you visited the\n",
        "Trainers’ School?\r",
        "Did your friend not guide you there\n",
        "earlier?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HelloHaveYouVisitedTrainersSchool",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Hello, my friend.\n",
        "Have you visited the Trainers’ School?\r",
        "Did your friend not guide you there\n",
        "earlier?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_ItIsYouHaveYouNotObtainedAPoketch",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it is you! Have no fear.\n",
        "There are no shady characters about.\r",
        "Incidentally, have you not obtained\n",
        "a Pokétch?\r",
        "I believe a Pokétch is now free in\n",
        "exchange for some Coupons?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_TellMeHaveYouNotObtainedAPoketch",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Tell me, have you not obtained\n",
        "a Pokétch?\r",
        "I believe a Pokétch is now free in\n",
        "exchange for some Coupons?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HaveYouNotObtainedAGymBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it is you! Have no fear.\n",
        "There are no shady characters about.\r",
        "Incidentally, have you not obtained\n",
        "a Gym Badge?\r",
        "I believe you receive one for defeating\n",
        "the Gym Leader at a Pokémon Gym?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HaveYouNotObtainedAPalPad",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Tell me, have you not obtained\n",
        "a Pal Pad?\r",
        "Is not a Pal Pad free to anyone visiting\n",
        "the Pokémon Center’s basement?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_YouObtainedPalPad",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, yes. I see that you have obtained\n",
        "it, a Pal Pad for yourself.\r",
        "I myself, a member of the International\n",
        "Police, the fighters of crime around the\f",
        "world, have one also.\r",
        "For it is what one must have to trade\n",
        "Pokémon with Trainers around the world.\r",
        "Take that Pal Pad to the Global Terminal\n",
        "for trading on an international level!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_TakeInvestigationElsewhere",
      "en_US": [
        "Anyway, there appears to be no one\n",
        "shady in this Jubilife City.\r",
        "I shall therefore take my investigation\n",
        "elsewhere.\r",
        "But, my friend, I suggest you remain\n",
        "vigilant for shady grown-ups!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_YouHaveNoPoketch",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, oh, oh?\r",
        "You call yourself a Pokémon Trainer?\n",
        "And yet you have no Pokétch?\r",
        "That is, Pokémon Watch, or Pokétch\n",
        "for short!\r",
        "Oh my, you are a rare case\n",
        "indeed!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_FindThreeClowns",
      "en_US": [
        "You see, I invented, and now\n",
        "manufacture, Pokétches.\r",
        "Not only that, I’m now conducting\n",
        "the Pokétch promotional campaign!\r",
        "All you have to do is find three\n",
        "clowns in Jubilife City.\r",
        "If you can find them...\n",
        "I will gift you with a Pokétch!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_CollectCouponFromEachClown",
      "en_US": [
        "I'm the president of the Pokétch\n",
        "Company, and I'm in a real pickle!\r",
        "A case of our prototypes went\n",
        "missing during that rally.\r",
        "No prototypes, no campaign...\n",
        "and no Pokétch for you. Sorry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PokemonWatchInReturnForCoupons",
      "en_US": [
        "That case... Our prototypes!\n",
        "You brought them back!\r",
        "Bravo! I say, bravo!\r",
        "Please, take this Pokémon Watch,\n",
        "or Pokétch for short!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PlayerReceivedAPoketch",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a {COLOR 1}Pokétch{COLOR 0}!{YESNO 1}"
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_AddAppsToPoketch",
      "en_US": [
        "You can add apps to your Pokétch\n",
        "to make it even more versatile!\r",
        "Touch the Pokétch screen and find the\n",
        "apps that are right for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DoPokemonGrowByDefeatingOthers",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: Our prototypes vanished\n",
        "during the rally! No campaign today.\r",
        "A man in a trench coat was eyeing\n",
        "the crowd. He's by the east exit!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_AbsolutelyCorrect1",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: You got the case back?!\n",
        "Quick, show the president!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WrongAnswer1",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: A man in a trench coat left\n",
        "something with the president.\f",
        "He was asking about you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_GrowStrongerByDefeatingOthers",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon grow stronger by defeating\n",
        "other Pokémon in battle.\r",
        "Some Pokémon even grow into an\n",
        "entirely different form in a process\f",
        "known as evolution.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HeresPoketchCoupon1",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, there you are! A man in a\n",
        "trench coat dropped this off.\r",
        "Our stolen prototypes! He said\n",
        "you'd earned it.\r",
        "Please, take this Pokémon Watch,\n",
        "or Pokétch for short!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PokemonGrowStrongerThroughBattling",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: The prototypes are back, and\n",
        "you got a Pokétch! Honk honk!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DoMovesHaveTypes",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: Honk... Our prototype case\n",
        "got swiped in all that rally noise.\r",
        "That trench-coat fellow at the east\n",
        "exit saw something. Ask him!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_AbsolutelyCorrect2",
      "en_US": [
        "Ding-ding!\n",
        "You’re absolutely correct!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WrongAnswer2",
      "en_US": [
        "And as thanks for the prototypes,\n",
        "here's an app we just finished!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_IfPokemonMatchTypeMoveMorePowerful",
      "en_US": [
        "Our prototypes can read faint\n",
        "signals...\r",
        "I'd hate to think what someone\n",
        "would track with them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HeresPoketchCoupon2",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the case back!"
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_IfPokemonMatchTypeMoveMorePowerful2",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: Prototypes home safe! Now I\n",
        "can finally take off this wig."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_CanAPokemonHoldAnItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: No quiz today! Someone took\n",
        "our prototypes during the rally.\r",
        "Psst... the trench-coat man at the\n",
        "east exit saw it all."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_AbsolutelyCorrect3",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: I dragged it across\n",
        "the whole city! It's your turn!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WrongAnswer3",
      "en_US": [
        "Man in a Trench Coat: Pardon me.\n",
        "That case looks heavy. May I help?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PokemonMayHoldSingleItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: It's that snoop from\n",
        "the rally! Scram!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HeresPoketchCoupon3",
      "en_US": [
        "Man in a Trench Coat: ...Pokétch\n",
        "prototypes. Why would they want\f",
        "those?\r",
        "Take it back to the company, kid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_YouShouldStickAround",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, there. You should stick around.\n",
        "We’re doing a Pokétch campaign soon.\r",
        "Before it starts, I think you should\n",
        "brush up at the Trainers’ School."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_PokemonMayHoldSingleItem2",
      "en_US": [
        "Clown: Try every app on your\n",
        "Pokétch! Even the silly ones!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_HandOverResearchFindings",
      "en_US": [
        "Mystery man: Now, now, now, now, now!\n",
        "Professor Rowan, you must comply.\r",
        "Hand over all your research findings.\n",
        "For free, naturally.\r",
        "Failure to comply will result in a painful\n",
        "time for your assistant.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_ThatsOreburghsGymBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Well? How is the Pokédex progressing?\r",
        "Hm!\n",
        "That’s Oreburgh’s Gym Badge, I see.\r",
        "But hadn’t I given you your first\n",
        "Pokémon only recently...?\r",
        "Perhaps being a Trainer is like second\n",
        "nature to you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_MustYouBeSoDifficult",
      "en_US": [
        "Mystery man: Oh, professor of Pokémon,\n",
        "must you be so difficult?\r",
        "We are speaking to you on business.\n",
        "Because this is work for us.\r",
        "What we’re saying is--we demand\n",
        "you comply with our demands.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WhyMustYouBeSuchANuisance",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Quiet, you lot!\n",
        "Why must you be such a nuisance?\r",
        "Let me list some lessons you still\n",
        "need to learn.\r",
        "#1: Don’t loiter about for no good\n",
        "reason.\r",
        "#2: Don’t interrupt others while they\n",
        "are attempting to converse.\r",
        "#3: If you don’t get your way, don’t\n",
        "raise your voice to be intimidating.\r",
        "#4: Don’t think you’ve grown strong\n",
        "just because you’re in a group.\r",
        "#5: What is with those outlandish\n",
        "outfits you have on?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_YouCallYourselvesAdults",
      "en_US": [
        "My goodness...\n",
        "You call yourselves adults?\r",
        "You kids, don’t grow up to be like these\n",
        "sorry specimens.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_RegretInsultingTeamGalactic",
      "en_US": [
        "Mystery man: Eeeeeh!\n",
        "You had to make this personal!\r",
        "You have forced our hand into making\n",
        "a show of force!\r",
        "We will make you regret insulting\n",
        "Team Galactic!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_GiveThugsALessonInCivility",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: You kids, give these thugs a\n",
        "lesson in civility, please.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnPlayerLetsBattleTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Let’s battle together!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasPlayerJoinMeAndBattleTheseGuys",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Join me and battle these guys!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_WeWillRetreatForNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: You leave us no option.\n",
        "We will retreat for now.\r",
        "We shall do so because Team Galactic\n",
        "is benevolent to all.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_CalledThemselvesTeamGalactic",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: That lot...\n",
        "They called themselves Team Galactic.\r",
        "When Pokémon evolve, they seem to\n",
        "release some type of energy...\r",
        "However, I believe that it’s a mystic\n",
        "power far beyond our control.\r",
        "But Team Galactic seems to be studying\n",
        "that power’s potential.\r",
        "They want to know if it can be used as\n",
        "energy for something...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_DawnProfessorStudiesEvolutionOfPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, did you know?\r",
        "The professor studies the evolution\n",
        "of Pokémon, too.\r",
        "According to his research, 90% of all\n",
        "Pokémon are somehow tied to evolution!\r",
        "Well, maybe that’s the reason those\n",
        "people tried to take the professor’s\f",
        "research data by force.\r",
        "That’s really unforgivable!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCity_Text_LucasProfessorStudiesEvolutionOfPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, did you know\n",
        "about this?\r",
        "The professor studies the\n",
        "evolution of Pokémon, too.\r",
